H1' Find the map of a dotted name once per row, with results in registers. Against include/ of c5864bf; apply with git apply -p1 in the directory that holds include/.
H1 (h1.patch of the fewer-calls probe, rebased on c5864bf) and: Table::find, Access::find, Walk::lookup and the find of typed::Access return Value (absent is Value{nullptr, nullptr});
value_is_absent of the data type tells absent; Access::bound and typed::Access::bound return std::optional<Value> (not bound is std::nullopt);
first_part_of is MUSTACHE_ALWAYS_INLINE; the path of op.e >= kFirstPartIdMax is first_part_without_id, MUSTACHE_NEVER_INLINE.
